    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Game Story-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a broke private detective struggling to pay rent, with eviction looming over your head. Just when things seem hopeless, a stroke of luck brings a stunning client to your office, seeking help to unravel the mysteries of her troubled marriage.  <br> <br>Using your sharp detective skills, you'll gather clues, uncover evidence, and piece together the truth. Along the way, you'll rely on old connections from your past, only to stumble upon a deeper mystery one that reveals secrets about yourself.  <br> <br>Get ready for an intriguing love mystery where every woman you meet has a unique story to tell. Each encounter brings you closer to solving the case... and maybe even to a romance  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Core Gameplay-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>-Solve Puzzle</strong>  <br>Uncover the gripping story and delve into the mysteries hidden within the dialogues of NPCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/ebb242f7c5125415607416ed58b3f3bc.poster.webp?t=1754126129\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/ebb242f7c5125415607416ed58b3f3bc.webp?t=1754126129\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Detective Vision</strong>  <br>Use your detective skills to uncover evidence and solve countless puzzles within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/a4a9caeb85eaa44ca7c614d480a57193.poster.webp?t=1754126129\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/a4a9caeb85eaa44ca7c614d480a57193.webp?t=1754126129\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Mini-Game</strong>s <br>Enjoy up to 5 mini-games, packed with rewards that directly impact the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/9ad62650442e89a77bc06310a117b704.poster.webp?t=1754126129\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/9ad62650442e89a77bc06310a117b704.webp?t=1754126129\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Features-.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-8 sexy unique female characters has their own fully-developed story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-An exciting array of events and CGs for you to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dynamic character illustration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-High quality animated H-scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/47ee4ed8f9b9c50e71991bc974265e33.avif?t=1754126129\" width=1920 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/6ca4b3fb09b5737af2466130123c2a0e.poster.webp?t=1754126129\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839350/extras/6ca4b3fb09b5737af2466130123c2a0e.webp?t=1754126129\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p>",
